[ti:Twinkle, Twinkle, Little Star]
[ar:CommandSpry]
[00:00.00]
[00:04.36]Twinkle, twinkle, little star
[00:07.38]How I wonder what you are
[00:09.78]Up above the world so high
[00:11.88]Like a diamond in the sky
[00:14.39]When the blazing sun is gone
[00:16.70]When he nothing shines upon
[00:18.90]Then you show your little light
[00:21.16]Twinkle, twinkle, all the night
[00:24.00]
